{"id":"naruchniki","lemma":"наручники","pos":"noun","rank":1944,"glosses":["handcuffs, manacles"],"gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"наручников","plural":"наручники"},"examples":[{"text":"В наручники его.","en":"Cuff him.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/748254","words":[{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"him / his"}]},{"text":"Я был без наручников.","en":"I wasn't handcuffed.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"without"},null]},{"text":"Том будет без наручников.","en":"Tom won't be handcuffed.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},{"g":"without"},null]},{"text":"Я надел на него наручники.","en":"I put handcuffs on him.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to put on, to get on","l":"надеть"},{"g":"on / at"},{"g":"he, it","l":"он"},null]},{"text":"Том сказал, что он без наручников.","en":"Tom said he wasn't handcuffed.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"сказать"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"without"},null]}]}